                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "There was a consensus to revise the weightage of criteria, emphasizing patient education programs and operational size while reducing the emphasis on social media presence.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "e88545e2-1f28-4f1c-81ad-affba3873eb0",
                    "time": 0,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v10"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The team agreed on the importance of ensuring critical parameters like revenue and employee numbers are adequately represented with minimum weight to enhance the scoring system's balance.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
